      "content": "It is our solemn duty, as enlightened Britons, to bring the light of civilization to these dark corners of the world. These peoples, lacking the proper structure and industry, require the firm guidance of our superior governance to escape the chaos of their own customs. We introduce them to the benefits of modern agriculture, sound administration, and the glorious institutions of British law, which are far superior to their tribal squabbles. Through this necessary mission, we are not merely conquering, but elevating these populations to a standard worthy of modern humanity.",
